Package: geozl
Type: Package
Title: Geospatial Codecs for 'OpenZL'
Version: 0.18.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cesar", "Aybar", email = "cesar@asterisk.coop",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Asterisk Labs", role = "cph"),
    person("Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates", role = "cph",
           comment = "OpenZL and Zstandard"),
    person("Yann", "Collet", role = "cph", comment = "LZ4"))
Description: R bindings to 'GeoZL', the geospatial codecs for 'OpenZL'.
    Compresses raster tiles with spatial predictors, a NoData mask and
    bounded-error quantizers, and reads and writes the same frames as the
    'Python' package.
